# desky-head include/

Head = face-unit: eyes (OV3660) + face OLED + MCU + talk-wire.
Smart lives in desky-core, drawings live here.

- `mcu/` — board truth (AI Thinker ESP32-CAM + OV3660 map, constraints);
  swap MCUs via `mcu/active_mcu.h` only.
- `config.h` — tunables (HEAD_BOOT_LEAN, rates); never hardcode pins here.
- `head_context.h` — Arduino-free shared vocabulary: face ids, power-matrix
  states, the ONE command-table verb struct, head event types (host-tested).
